  "prompt": "How many customers came back within 30 days of their first order? Take each customer's first order day in UTC (order times are stored in UTC). A customer came back when they have another order on a later UTC day that is at most 30 days after that first day: an order on the first day itself does not count, and one exactly 30 days later does. Guest orders have no customer_id and do not count. Return one column, returning_customers. Return one row. Any row order is fine.",
